OL,3,ADriver threatened with knife as bus
OL,4,Ahijacked and chased in police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fhijacked bus was brought to a stop
OL,8,Fafter a police chase.
OL,10,FThe driver of the bus was threatened at
OL,11,Fknife point by a man, who then allowed
OL,12,Fpassengers to leave the bus. However,
OL,13,Fthe bus driver was kept on board.
OL,15,FVideos circulating on social media
OL,16,Fappear to show a Translink Goldliner
OL,17,Fcoach being driven at speed through
OL,18,Fresidential streets while being chased
OL,19,Fby a Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,20,F(PSNI) patrol car.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
