OL,3,ADriver threatened with knife as bus
OL,4,Ahijacked and chased in police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the bus was hijacked in the
OL,7,FBeltany Road area of Omagh, Co Tyrone,
OL,8,Fshortly before 13:00 BST on Saturday.
